  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.ApproachYourCamp": "As you approach your camp, you can see that Jack Frost's efforts are paying off. A great, constant flurry of snowflakes is gently drifting down, swaying in the wind as it makes its inevitable descent towards the ground. A layer of snowflakes is quickly building up, growing wider and deeper as more snow is launched from out of the mountains to rain down on your camp. You can't help but enjoy the cool air as the snowflakes fall down languidly onto the ground. It's so beautiful you almost forget the rather perverted origin of it all.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.ApproachingAskWhats": "[pg]Approaching her, you ask what's gotten her so worried?"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.AsEvidencedByWord": ", as evidenced by "
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.AskFirstTime": "[pg]You ask if this is [ember eir] first time seeing snow. It always snowed back home around this time of the year. Why... back when you were a child, you used to play all the time in the snow."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.AskIfHedLike": "[pg]You ask if he'd like a hand doing that, being as it's been so long since he had a chance to do that? Rathazul nods. [say: I would love it! Help me with the base.]"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.AsksInBafflement": "[pg][say: ...You are?] she asks in obvious bafflement--her tail actually curls itself into a crude question-mark shape behind her for emphasis."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.AtThisLooksCrestfallen": "[pg]At this, she looks crestfallen. [say: I am sorry, mein little sweety, but I am having no yochalot on me--I drank ze last of mine some time ago, and I do not think zey have such thing in this vorld any more. At least, none that has not been tampered with, like the demons have ruined so many other nice things.] She scowls. [say: The only thing I could be offering you is nice, warm milk, fresh from the tap, so to speak.] She pats her hefty quad-nippled boobs to make it clear where the milk would come from."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.BackHomeMineLand": "[say: Back home, in mine land, it vould be snowing all over at this time of year, and ve vould be having big vinter festival to celebrate ze ending of old year and coming of new year. This land, it is so dry and hot... I had forgotten it, but seeing zis snow makes me remember it and all I have lost by being stuck here,] she sighs."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.BackHomeOldLand": "[say: Back home, in my old land, it would be snowing all over at this time of year, and we would be having a big winter festival to celebrate the ending of the old year and the coming of the new one. This land, it's so dry and hot... I had forgotten it, but seeing this snow makes me remember it and all I have lost by being stuck here,] she sighs."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.BeginGatheringSnow": "[pg]You begin gathering snow along with the old rat..."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.BeginTicklingBreasts": "[pg]You begin tickling her breasts, belly, arms, anywhere your wiggling fingers can touch. Izma cackles and screeches, tears running down her face even as she pleads for you to stop; evidently, that tough orange and black-striped skin doesn't make her any less vulnerable to a good tickling session. You don't heed her pleas, continuing to tickle the tiger-shark with abandon. [say: All right, all right, stopit-stopit-stopit, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!] she cries. You tell her that if she wishes you to stop all she has to do is admit, you're the alpha and she's the beta... The tigershark tries, you have to give her points for that, but she can't quite gasp the words out around her laughter. You tell her that her performance was lacking, so if she'll excuse you... you have more tickling to do. [say: No! Please, no, I'm sorry, you're the alpha and I'm the beta and I'll never forget it again!] she cries. Satisfied, you turn her around, giving her a quick kiss and a tap on her nose. With a wink you tell her to never forget that again. [say: I promise to always remember that--I know who's the conqueror in our little relationship.] She grins, displaying her shark fangs. Smiling, you wish her Happy Holidays. [say: Happy... whatever that is. I just hope our next ones aren't so painful,] she replies, clutching her side for emphasis."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.BovineIsabellaStaring": "The bovine adventurer Isabella is staring at the snow around her with a sad look on her face, one hand gently raised to catch snowflakes. She watches them gather in her palm and heaves a huge sigh. You quietly approach her and ask what's wrong; is she homesick?"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.BowsThenSlides": "[pg]Amily bows respectfully. [say: Right away, [master].] She quickly slides through the snow into position, kneeling before you with all the respect of a devout nun at prayer, and begins to run her nimble fingers expertly through your cunt, tickling and fondling your [clit] with her long spade-tipped tail as her fingers probe and slide through your netherlips, sending sparks coursing through your being."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.ByTimeYoureDone": "[pg]By the time you're done Ember's tail is waving excitedly behind her. You ask how she'd feel about a snowball fight?"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.CalmlyWipeSnow": "[pg]You calmly wipe the snow off your face and smile evilly at the monk, asking him if he realizes this means war..."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.CanTellYouWere": ". You can tell that you were not the only one needing this break... but unfortunately all good things must come to an end, and so you bid your companion"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.CantHelpButLaugh": "[pg]You can't help but laugh lightly at Amily's wariness. There's no need to be this worried. You're responsible for today's snowing as a matter of fact."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.CantResistLaughing": "[pg]You can't resist laughing out loud. You were just testing to see if he had his guard up."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.CasuallyApproachBehind": "[pg]You casually approach him from behind, stripping off your [armor]. Once behind his heart-shaped ass, you pull on his tail and reach down to grope at his shaft and balls. Silly slut, you tell him. This is not how one fucks in the snow... if he doesn't know how to do it right, you'll be happy to demonstrate."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.CertainlyDontMindStaying": "[pg]You certainly don't mind staying behind for now, it is certainly a lot of fun spending time with your {0} and just having fun. Your cow-girl daughters are certainly not lacking in energy in the cold snow, their fur covered legs and built in shoes probably help a lot with this. {1} with rapt attention when you explain what snow is, and about all the things you use to do in it back home. Hands-on demonstrations are also in high demand."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.ClickTongueShaking": "[pg]You click your tongue, shaking your head. You tell her that there is no escape from her destiny. The shark-{0} promptly twists around in the snow and tries to dive away from you, forgetting that snow isn't as reactive to such efforts as water would be. You grab her shark-tail and pull her back. [say: No, please, don't! Anything but that!] Izma wails as she is dragged to her inevitable tickling doom."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.ColdNotWilling": "[pg]Cold and not willing to keep the salamander-girl waiting, you eagerly strip off your [armor] and pounce towards her..."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.CoughingUpSnow": "[pg]Coughing up some snow, you concede defeat, congratulating Ember on winning [ember eir] first snowball fight... but then, you smirk and tell [ember em] this was all beginner's luck... and next time you'll beat [ember em] for sure."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.CriesDoingHerBest": "[pg][say: All right! Now let's get this party started!] she cries, doing her best to grab handfuls of melting slush and hurl them at you before they completely dissolve."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.DaNameIAm": "[pg][say: Da, [name], I am,]"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.DemandsBlushing": "[pg][say: W-what are you doing, doofus?] she demands, blushing--which, coincidentally, makes her grow noticeably warmer in your arms. You chuckle and tell her you're just helping her stay warm, and by the feel of things, it seems to be working. You can't have her setting your camp ablaze with her sneezes, so this was absolutely necessary, you tell her, hoping to cull any incoming protests. However, you don't miss the opportunity to run your hands over her back, down her scaled tail, and over her wonderful buttcheeks."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.DragonPromptlyDrops": "[pg]The dragon promptly drops to [ember em] knees and starts sweeping together huge armfuls of snow, crushing and melding them together until [ember ey] has made a snowball the size of a small boulder, which [ember ey] promptly hurls at you."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.DragonWanderingCamp": "The dragon is wandering your camp in open fascination. [say: What is this weird white stuff? It's cold and wet... but soft and fluffy, too,] [ember ey] says, gently catching a snowflake."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.DrippingVagina": "dripping [vagina]"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.EmberBragsThenLowers": "[pg][say: So you say, but the truth is you know you'll never beat me,] Ember brags. Then [ember ey] lowers her eyelids and gives you a coy look. [say: And now, for the victor, a prize,] [ember ey] growls, then swoops in to kiss you passionately. Several minutes pass before [ember ey] breaks the kiss, a somewhat goofy smile on [ember eir] face. [say: I'm going to go and play in the snow some more. See you, [name].] [ember Ey] giggles, then ambles off."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.EmberNotesDepressed": "[pg][say: So it's for kids,] Ember notes, sounding kind of depressed--and a little envious, especially given the way she still looks so eagerly at the snow all around you."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.EmberProtests": "[pg][say: I thought you said this was for little kids? I'm no baby!] Ember protests."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.EmberSaysBlowing": "[pg][say: What? I... ooh, very well. Teach me how you play with this stuff,] Ember says, blowing a thin trail of steam out of each nostril."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.EnjoyBattleWithHelia": "[pg]You enjoy your 'battle' with Helia a while longer. Eventually, you're completely soaked, water dripping off your [armor]. You ask for Helia to stop for a moment, shivering as the cold finally gets to you."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.EvenTicklingYour": ", even tickling your [balls]"
