  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.ExplainRulesAnd": "[pg]You explain to [ember em] the rules and walk a short distance away... then declare the match started! Ember is pretty good... but being [ember eir] first time doing this, [ember ey] ends up not being able to hit you as many times as you hit [ember em], while you expertly dodge and roll her snowballs."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.ExplainToHerIts": "[pg]You explain to her it's just having fun in the snow... something you used to do a lot as a child. You'd build snowmen, make snow angels, have a snowball fight-"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.ExplainToKiha": "[pg]You explain to Kiha it's just snow. You had a friend you met recently help you make it snow in your camp, since it would be snowing around this time of the year, back home. You thought it would be fun to take a break from adventuring to enjoy the snow... at least for a day."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.FasterThanExpected": "[pg]Faster than you would have expected, Jojo stoops down, rolls a snowball and smacks you right in the face with it. [say: Two can play at that game,] he says, a faint grin playing on his features."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.FeastProgresses": "[pg]The feast progresses without a hitch. You cheer, eat and drink together (though you really don't have any appropriate alcohol for the evening). As the feast progresses, you notice more than one pair of hungry eyes sizing you up... it seems your day is far from over..."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.FeelingClosePullAgain": "[pg]Feeling yourself getting close, you pull away from the corrupt mousette and stand over a particularly soft-looking mound of snow. With a few more prods from your questing fingers and a little pinch on your [clit] you moan throatily and let your femcum spill out of your [vagina]. Wave after wave of juices spill, sliding along your [legs] to mat the white snow. By the time you're done the whole area around you smells of pussy juice and sex... truly a delightful aroma."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.FeelingCloseYouPull": "[pg]Feeling yourself getting close, you pull away from the corrupt mousette and aim yourself at a particularly soft-looking mound of snow. With a few more pumps you moan and blast your load, soaking the snow in spunk. You tell Amily there she has it... her cum-cone is ready for the picking."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.FinallyFinishCumming": "[pg]As you finally finish cumming, Helia lifts her head and starts to laugh. [say: Oh, man, not how I'd usually do it, but whoo, what a ride, huh?] she laughs. You laugh as well. It certainly felt good, though this is far from what you're used to. You have to give Helia's wrestling idea some credit. Rolling around with her, grinding together was pretty hot--in more ways than one."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.FindMarbleStaring": "You find Marble simply staring into the sky, a look of wonder covering her face. Dancing around her in excitement {0} your {1}, playing in the snow, blowing the snow, and experimenting with the snow. Exactly what {2} up to at any given moment is really hard to say, and you're not even sure that the little {3} know{4}"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.FindMarbleStaringAgain": "You find Marble simply staring into the sky, a look of wonder covering her face. She lifts up her hand, then takes a step forward as you approach. It looks like she is about to catch a flake in her hands, only to instead suddenly slip on the frozen ground under her hoofs, and fall down onto her backside with a cry of surprise. [say: Oww...] she grumbles, giving her backside a rub as you come up in front of her. You tell her to be careful, that stuff can be slippery while extending your hand to help her up. [say: Yeah, thanks sweetie, I noticed,] she sighs and accepts your hand."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.FinishAndSilence": "[pg]You finish, and silence once again fills the air as you two continue to watch the snow fall. [say: Sweetie?] Marble suddenly speaks out, [say: I want to have kids with you some day.] You look at her somewhat surprised, she continues to simply look ahead, continuing, [say: I want them to experience those things too, and there is no one else that I'd rather have them with then you.] There isn't much else to do but to look back at the falling flakes once more."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.FireyLizardAsks": "[pg][say: What's a snow-day play-day?] The firey lizard-girl asks, clearly not understanding the reference; it may not have snowed in the plains even before this accursed drought."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.GaspsLoyalCumGuzzling": "[pg]Amily gasps. [say: O-Of course! I'm [master]'s loyal cum-guzzling mouse-slut. I'm ready to serve anytime! Thank you for letting me play in the snow.] She grins gratefully at you."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.GladShellLike": "[pg]You're glad she's liking it, you tell her, getting up to brush the snow off you. You tell her she should enjoy it while it lasts, you reckon it won't last more than a day..."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.GladToDemonstrate": "[pg]You'll be glad to demonstrate, you grin back. [say: Oh, really? So, what do you have in mind, my [name]?] she asks, feigning ignorance with terrible acting skills."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.GoodNightRetire": " good night and retire for the night."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.GreetSalamanderLover": "[pg]You greet your salamander lover, telling her you found a way to make it snow on your camp... so you were just planning on having a snow-day play-day on your camp, while it lasts."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.GrinThenEnvelop": "[pg]You grin at her then envelop her lips into a kiss... sounds like a plan, you're feeling a bit cold and this would be a nice way to warm you right up..."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.HeardQuestionApproach": "[pg]Having heard [ember eir] question, you approach Ember and tell [ember em] that's just snow."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.HeliaCallsSees": "[say: Hey, champ, what's going on here?] Helia calls as she sees you approach. Gentle trails of steam are wafting from the salamander's body as her own internal heat melts any snow that builds up on her."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.HeliaCheersSteam": "[pg][say: Fight? Now you're talking my language!] Helia cheers. The cloud of steam around her gets even denser as she starts melting the snow she's standing in. You give her a wry glance and point out she can't really participate if she's so hot that the snowballs melt to slush in her hands."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.HeliaDoesntListen": "[pg]Helia doesn't listen as she hurls a handful of water straight at you, splashing your face with molten snow. [say: Looks like I hit you pretty well there!] She laughs uproariously. Well... if this is how she intends to play... You quickly roll up a ball of snow of your own and toss it at her! It connects with a hiss as the snowball quickly melts off her body."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.HeliaLaughsTurns": "[pg][say: Heh, yeah, a nice wrestle in the wet's always been like that for us salamanders,] Helia laughs. [say: Don't worry, sexy, we'll take care of that in a minute... but first!] She suddenly turns and lunges at you, knocking you over and pinning you to the ground, thanks to the advantage of attacking while your guard was off. Your shocked yelp is promptly smothered as she kisses you fiercely, grinding her sopping-wet gash against your crotch."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.InsinuatesGentlyTapping": "[pg][say: Oh, were you maybe wanting another turn, lover?] Helia insinuates, gently tapping her fingers on your chest. You make a show of considering her offer, then, with a smile, say that sounds like a reasonable proposal. You promptly wrap the salamander-girl, into a tight hug, spreading her legs so you can have access to her dripping vagina..."
