  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.KihaSnifflesWipes": "[pg]Kiha sniffles and wipes her nose on her arm when she sees you. [say: [name], what is this weird white stuff? It's cold and wet and-- Achoo!] She sneezes again, spraying a gout of flame across the camp. [say: And the flakes keep flying up my nose,] she snuffles."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.KissHerBack": "[pg]You kiss her back, trying your best to turn the tables on the fiery salamander, rubbing your body against hers with as much enthusiasm as her. Breaking the kiss shortly, you tell her that was a pretty low move, and call her a cheater."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.KnowWhatThis": "[pg][say: [name], do you know what this is?] your lover asks while raising her arms in the air and looking around in amazement once more. [say: How can stuff fall from the sky?] You laugh, and say that it's snow, or frozen rain. The cow-girl looks at you in confusion once more and asks what rain is. Now it is your turn to be surprised, she has never seen it rain before in her life? It has never gotten cloudy and water has fallen from the sky? Marble shakes her head no, [say: Sweetie, I'm not sure what a cloud is either. Every day of my life has always been sunny and warm. This is something I've never experienced before...]"
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.KnowWhatThisAgain": "[pg][say: [name], do you know what this is?] your lover asks while raising her arms in the air and looking around in amazement once more. [say: How can stuff fall from the sky?] You laugh, and say that it's snow, or frozen rain. The cow-girl looks at you in confusion once more and asks what rain is. Now it is your turn to be surprised, she has never seen it rain before in her life? It has never gotten cloudy and water has fallen from the sky? Marble shakes her head no, [say: Sweetie, I'm not sure what a cloud is either. Every day of my life has always been sunny and warm. This is something I've never experienced before...]"
