  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.LaughAndHugBack": "[pg]You laugh and hug her back, telling Amily to take it easy. With all the friction the two of you are making, hugging together and nuzzling, you might just end up melting all the snow. The mouse looks into your eyes. [say: Oooh, you little tempter, you,] she trills, tail looping around your wrist. [say: Maybe I wouldn't mind that...?] she suggests mischievously."
