  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.LaughsAsSurfaces": "[pg]She laughs as she surfaces amidst a spray of slush, whipping her long hair around. [say: That's the way to do it, lover-[boy]!] she crows."
  "Scenes.Xmasjackfrost.ProcessJackFrostEvent.LaughsBreastsJiggling": "[pg][say: You are just ze sweetest little thing, aren't you, [name]?] Isabella laughs, her breasts jiggling heavily from the force. [say: Vell, if you are liking mein milk so much, perhaps you should have some more, da?] She grins, gently lifting one breast with a free hand to better offer it to you."
